      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 533,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "[Missing, the Cleaner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 534,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "Huh? Is this your first time seeing culverts? You'll see many buried machines in the ground. You may look around and come back!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 537,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "[Missing, the Cleaner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 538,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "That's right! Those culverts are very important! We must clean the culverts to prevent seaweed from blocking them. This is what we, cleaners, do!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 540,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "[Missing, the Cleaner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 541,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "Watch out! Some monsters will be after you while you're cleaning the culverts! But do not yield to them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 543,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "[Missing, the Cleaner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 544,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "And... NEVER let 6 seaweeds stack! Up to 5 is acceptable! If there are 6, I'll drag you out of here!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 546,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "[Missing, the Cleaner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 547,
      "npc" : "F_mal_missing",
      "text" : "I don't care if you get help from your friends or not. I want you to clean up all culverts! Don't forget! I will watch you and give you instructions. Just do what I said!!"
